# Copy this file to .env and fill in your key. .env is gitignored — it is
# never committed. Only used by `npm run translate` and `npm run translate:content`
# (see scripts/translate.mjs); the site build never reads it and stays hermetic.

# Anthropic API key, for the translation pipeline. Get one at
# https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
#
# Replaced DEEPL_API_KEY. DeepL translated one string at a time with no
# surrounding context, which is what produced a buddy system described as a
# "mating" system and a submit button whose in-flight label read as the
# imperative "Send". The current pipeline sends a whole dictionary per request
# so terminology and register are decided once — see scripts/lib/glossary.mjs.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
